# Generated by tools/perf/gen_scenarios.py from Skyrim exterior cell positions; coordinates in Skyrim units,
# angles in degrees like the in-game getangle (yaw 0 = north, 90 = east; positive pitch looks down).
# z "+N" = N units above the terrain at that point.
# Spins above the Throat of the World: 720 degrees level, then 360 looking down (~6 s).
name vista-spin
world tamriel
resolution 2560 1440
draw_distance 12
start 55296 -51200 +2000 0 0
segment level
spin 720 3.5
segment down
teleport 55296 -51200 +2000 0 25
spin 360 2.5
